   "parentNote": {
    "text": "Built from the teacher's math update about the multiplication facts pop quiz (50 facts in 3 minutes). Her attached flashcards and practice sheet did not reach Drive, so the facts and strategies here are ours, not copies of hers. This part covers 15 facts. Every answer, strategy step and wrong option was computed, not typed. The facts run to 12 × 12; if her sheet stops at 10 × 10, the x11 and x12 facts are extra. The Facts sprint on each card is the pop quiz shape: typed answers against one clock.",
    "from": "added"
   },
   "nextUp": {
    "text": "Flip the cards once, then try a sprint and see which facts it catches.",
